# Uncharted Haven: "This land enters tapped. As it enters, choose a color. {T}: Add one mana of the chosen color" (CR 614.1c,
# 605.1a, 607.2d). Bot1 plays it on turn 1 and chooses red (not the color Crossroads Village's scenario uses): it enters tapped
# and cannot be tapped (refused). On turn 3 it adds red (the positive control) and no other color: green is refused.

[Bot1 Deck]
Uncharted Haven
Island x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Uncharted Haven.Play
Bot1.Colors(Red)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Uncharted Haven.Tapped = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Uncharted Haven.ChosenColor = Red
! Bot1.Battlefield.Uncharted Haven.Activate(Color: Red)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Uncharted Haven.Activate(Color: Green)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Uncharted Haven.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Uncharted Haven.Activate(Color: Red)
? Bot1.Mana = {R}

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Uncharted Haven.ChosenColor = Red
Bot1.Battlefield.Uncharted Haven.Tapped = true
